sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Admin
    participant O as Organizer
    participant B as Buyer
    participant S as Venue Scanner
    participant C as TicketTrust Contract
    A->>C: grantOrganizer(O), grantScanner(S)
    O->>C: registerEvent(eventId)
    O->>C: issueTicket(ticketId, eventId, B)
    C-->>B: TicketIssued / Valid
    B->>C: transferTicket(ticketId, buyer2) [optional]
    S->>C: getStatus(ticketId) via application
    C-->>S: eventId, holder, Valid
    S->>C: markUsed(ticketId)
    C-->>S: TicketUsed / status = Used
    S->>C: markUsed(ticketId) [repeat scan]
    C-->>S: revert: InvalidTicketState
